Print a shell completion script for `hpr`

Usage: hpr completions [OPTIONS] <SHELL>

Arguments:
  <SHELL>
          The shell to write the script for
          
          [possible values: bash, elvish, fish, powershell, zsh]

Options:
      --json
          Print one JSON document on standard output instead of text; errors too

      --color <WHEN>
          When to use color. Auto colors what goes to a terminal and heeds NO_COLOR, FORCE_COLOR and CLICOLOR_FORCE. JSON output never has color
          
          [default: auto]
          [possible values: auto, always, never]

  -h, --help
          Print help (see a summary with '-h')

  -V, --version
          Print version

Examples:
  Complete the commands and options in zsh:
      hpr completions zsh > ~/.zfunc/_hpr
  In bash:
      hpr completions bash > ~/.local/share/bash-completion/completions/hpr

Guide: https://hpr.fusionspace.co/cli.html#hpr-completions
